{"subject":"Do not submit claim C021670 - duplicate of C005356","body":"Hi billing lead,

Please do not submit claim C021670 (patient PT0164, service S5125, date of service 2026-10-18, 6 units, $32.40). The same member, service and date is already billed and paid, or predicted to be paid, as claim C005356. Submitting C021670 would likely be denied as a duplicate (predicted denial code D05, from Northwind Health Plan).

The claim cannot be corrected by editing it, so it should be held or closed rather than filed. Please confirm once it has been removed from the submission queue. The claim is currently set for submission on 2026-11-23, so please confirm before then."}
